    <desc>Create a playlist using your favorite songs.</desc>
  </info>

  <title>Create playlists using songs</title>

  <p>You can create a playlist from any song in your library.</p>

  <steps>
    <title>To add a song to a playlist:</title>
    <item>
      <p>Click on the menu button next to the song you want to add.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Click on <gui>Add to Playlist…</gui>.</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Enter a name for your new playlist in the <gui>New Playlist…</gui> field and click <gui style="button">Add</gui>, or select an existing playlist from the list.</p>
    </item>
  </steps>

</page>
